### Dependency Injection Example - HTTP Requests

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/notifications

### Send Email Notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "message": "Hello from NestJS DI!"
}

### Send SMS Notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/sms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "message": "Hello from NestJS DI!"
}

### Send Both Email and SMS
POST {{baseUrl}}/both
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "message": "Hello from NestJS DI!"
}
